msgid ""
"A settings path is outside your home folder or protected. Nothing was reset."
msgstr "某個設定路徑位於您的個人資料夾之外或受到保護。未重設任何內容。"

#: biglinux-config/usr/share/biglinux/biglinux-config/backend/reset_manager.py:269
